1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,549
This Tesla can jump.

2
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,449
But its air supply

3
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:03,490
isn't endless.

4
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:04,629
These jets blast

5
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:05,810
compressed air.

6
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:06,609
Every burst

7
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:07,609
uses some up.

8
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:08,669
Hovering means pushing

9
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:09,409
against the car's

10
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:10,570
entire weight.

11
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:11,249
Bigger tanks

12
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,289
can buy more time,

13
00:00:12,290 --> 00:00:13,029
but add weight

14
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,190
and need protection.

15
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:15,890
Then comes balance.

16
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:16,729
Thrust that misses

17
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:17,569
the center of mass

18
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:18,709
can make it rotate.

19
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:19,329
Other thrusters

20
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:20,149
can correct that,

21
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,069
but those corrections

22
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,050
use air too.

23
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,209
And fire a jet

24
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,310
near loose gravel?

25
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,309
That blast can send

26
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:26,590
debris flying.

27
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:27,369
None of this

28
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:28,370
breaks physics.

29
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:29,529
It gives a sports car

30
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:30,790
spacecraft problems.

31
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:31,809
It also drives

32
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:32,770
upside down.

33
00:00:32,790 --> 00:00:34,070
Tap the linked breakdown.
